msgstr "https://ratingstar.de"

#. Description of the plugin
#: ratingstar.php
msgid "Embed your RatingStar seal and Google review stars (rich snippets) into WordPress."
msgstr "Bindet Ihr RatingStar-Siegel und Google-Bewertungssterne (Rich Snippets) in WordPress ein."

#. Author of the plugin
